""}, "type": "post_question"}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 1}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "Tipping", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Tips", "type": "text"}], "type": "incorrect"}, {"contents": {"content": "is very common in America. ", "type": ""}, "type": "post_question"}, {"content": "secondary_8", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nJulie likes to work as a server!\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: \n<span class=\"bullet\">Proofread the sentence.</span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Click on the incorrect word.</span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence.\n</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 9, "type": "GIW"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 10, "type": "RSLT"}, {"questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "engenn8le05ob02re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Make a poster to show what new servers are supposed to do.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le05ob02re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le05ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le05ob02re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tHello, Jose. Did you have a good weekend?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tYes, Miss Wright. Settling in is easier than I thought.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tCall me Vanessa. Addressing people by their first name at work is fine, unless you need to talk to our chef. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tI know. I should always show respect to the chef in the kitchen! It's the same in Colombia. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tI'm sure that many things are similar. For example, customers aren't supposed to smoke in the restaurant.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tWe banned smoking in public spaces in 2008 as well. How about legal drinking age?"}, {"time": "28000", "image": "engenn8le05ob02re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tWe are not supposed to serve alcohol to anyone under 21. The most important thing is making sure that customers don't break the law.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tWhat can I do to verify their age?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tYou are supposed to card anyone who looks below age. As a rule of thumb, you should card anyone who looks below 30.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tVery well. Are customers supposed to leave a tip? It is not common in Colombia."}, {"time": "50500", "image": "engenn8le05ob02re2img03.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tIt is strongly encouraged to leave tips, yes. Tipping is a usual practice  in the US. Serving tables of 6 guests or more should give you higher gratuities, too.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tSo, should I expect to get smaller tips from single customers?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tNot necessarily! You should always make them feel like you're giving them a good bang for their buck. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tSorry? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:\t\tIt means value for money.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\t\tGreat! I love learning new English expressions."}]}}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The New Waiter", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Settling In", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Exchange information about people's interests and backgrounds using a wider range of language.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Verb + -ing and to + verb", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A gerund is a noun made from a verb by adding \"-ing.\" You can use a gerund as the subject, the complement, or the object of a sentence.<br/><br/>The infinitive is the base form of a verb - \u201cto + verb\u201d.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "  A gerund is an action verb that is acting as a noun.  The noun refers to an activity instead of a person or thing.  Gerunds are written in their <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> form.You can use a gerund as the subject,  the complement, or the object of a sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Examples:<br/><br/> Subject of sentence:<br/> <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Settling</span> in is easier than I thought.</span><br/><br/> Complement of sentence:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">The most important thing is <span class=\"strong\">making </span>sure that customers don't break the law.</span><br/><br/> Object of sentence:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">We banned <span class=\"strong\">smoking</span> in public spaces in 2008 as well. </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "An infinitive is a verb form that acts as other parts of speech in a sentence. It is formed with to + base form of the verb. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"italic\">to talk</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to enjoy</span>, <span class=\"italic\">to play</span><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can<span class=\"italic\">not</span> add <span class=\"strong\">s</span> , <span class=\"strong\">es</span> , <span class=\"strong\">ed</span>, or  <span class=\"strong\">ing</span> to the end. It is not a verb.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example:<br/> It is strongly encouraged <span class=\"strong\">to leave</span> tips, yes. <br/>So, should I expect <span class=\"strong\">to get</span> smaller tips from single customers?</span>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Should and Be Supposed To ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the modal  <span class=\"strong\">should</span> or the  structure  <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use  <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> to talk about situations in the present or future that are expected to happen. <br/><br/> The structure is:<br/><br/>  Subject + To be + supposed to + verb<br/><br/>  <span class=\"italic\">You are <span class=\"strong\">supposed to</span> card anyone who looks below age.</span> <br/><br/>  **Pronunciation tip**:<br/> When you say be supposed to, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together.  <br/><br/> Like this:<br/> Be suppose_to", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Are customers supposed to leave a tip? It is not common in Colombia.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: You should always make them feel like you're giving them a good bang for their buck. ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "encouraged", "type": "name"}, {"content": "recommended", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is strongly encouraged to leave tips.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you hear in a conversation with a restaurant manager.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to ban", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to legally prohibit something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We banned smoking in public spaces in 2008.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "gratuity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "tip given for a service rendered", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Serving tables of 6 guests or more should give you higher gratuities.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "bang for their buck", "type": "name"}, {"content": "value for the money spent", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: An entire chicken dinner for five dollars really gives the customer bang for their buck.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "rule of thumb", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a general principle developed through experience and not scientifically. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "As a rule of thumb, you should card anyone who looks below 30.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to card", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to check ID in order to verify age", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "You are supposed to card anyone who looks below age.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le05ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Brainstorm some do's and don'ts for new servers who want to work in restaurants and make a list.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Imagine you are the manager of a restaurant.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a poster with 6-8 rules and regulations for new employees talking about things they are supposed to do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use gerunds and infinitives to express attitudes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present your poster to the rest of the class.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I talk about rules and regulations.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I  talk about things that I'm supposed to do and things that are  supposed to happen.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I  talk about my attitudes toward an action. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make a presentation.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}